# Trivy suppression file — S08-E04-S03 (GATE-S08 criterion S08-G5)
#
# RULES FOR THIS FILE, which are the whole point of it existing:
#
#   1. Every entry carries a CVE id, a reason, a named owner and an EXPIRY DATE.
#      An entry with no expiry is a permanent acceptance of a known vulnerability,
#      and 04-GATE-AND-SIGNOFF-MODEL.md Rule GS-5 is explicit that a waiver with
#      no expiry is a scope change wearing a disguise.
#
#   2. Suppression requires Deepali's Security sign-off. Engineering convenience
#      is not a reason. "Not reachable" is a reason only when the reachability
#      analysis is recorded and linked.
#
#   3. Entries are reviewed on every expiry date. An expired entry fails the
#      build, which is the intended behaviour — it forces the decision to be
#      re-taken rather than to lapse into permanence.
#
#   4. Anything suppressed here is ALSO recorded in
#      docs/governance/registers/RISK-REGISTER.md with its S0-S3 severity and
#      remediation SLA. A suppression that exists only in this file is invisible
#      to Compliance.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # owner: <persona> | expires: YYYY-MM-DD | reason: <why>

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CVE-2026-47884 — Spring Framework XsltView path limitation
# spring.io/security/cve-2026-47884 (MEDIUM). Trivy rates CRITICAL because the
# only public OSS fix is spring-webmvc 7.0.9 (Spring Framework 7 / Boot 4).
# 6.2.20 is Enterprise Support Only and is not on Maven Central. Boot 3.5.16
# is the last 3.5.x OSS line and pins 6.2.19. Jumping this monorepo to Boot 4
# is SUG-20261008-sb4 (parked), not a patch bump.
# Reachability: no service uses XsltView or a "/**" view-name rendering mapping;
# APIs are JSON RestControllers. RISK-021. Owner ADMIT-BYPASS 2026-10-08 to
# unblock PR #143; not a T4 Deepali signature.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CVE-2026-47884  # owner: Mahesh/repository_owner | expires: 2026-11-08 | reason: no OSS 6.2 patch; XsltView unused; Boot 4 parked as SUG-20261008-sb4; RISK-021
